7. On the basis of rival pleadings of both the parties, this court has framed the following issues;
ISSUES 1) Whether the petitioner proves that he had sustained grievous injuries in a motor vehicle accident that took place on 03.04.2023 at about 7-30 p.m., near Nice road junction, on Magadi main road,
Bangalore, due to rash and negligent driving of the driver of the Goods vehicle bearing registration No.KA-05-AH- 1189 in an actionable negligence?
